        <div class="sticky-pane">
          <canvas id="burgerCanvas" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
          <div class="layer-tag" id="layerTag" aria-hidden="true"><b>01 / 06</b> &nbsp;TOP BUN · FRONTEND</div>
        </div>
        <div class="chapters" id="chapters">

          <section class="chapter" data-layer="0">
            <span class="tag"><span class="swatch" style="background:#DD9A4E"></span><span class="t"><b>Layer 01</b> · Top bun · Frontend</span></span>
            <h2>WLF Club</h2>
            <p class="lead">Growth &amp; AI Automation Intern. <span>Redirected the whole strategy.</span></p>
            <p class="body">Analyzed 780+ CRM opportunities in GoHighLevel and found 95% never reached a decision despite a 92% win rate when worked, so I moved WLF's growth strategy from ad spend to backlog conversion. Also trained an internal RAG AI (Warvis), built a staff training site, and stood up the full analytics stack across three lead funnels.</p>
            <div class="stats">
              <div class="stat"><div class="n">780+</div><div class="l">CRM opportunities analyzed</div></div>
              <div class="stat"><div class="n">92%</div><div class="l">win rate when worked</div></div>
              <div class="stat"><div class="n">588</div><div class="l">users captured, 28 days</div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="links"><a href="https://wlfclub.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">wlfclub.com →</a></div>
          </section>

          <section class="chapter" data-layer="1">
            <span class="tag"><span class="swatch" style="background:#55833A"></span><span class="t"><b>Layer 02</b> · Lettuce · The fresh stuff</span></span>
            <h2>Webspansion</h2>
            <p class="lead">A web studio I founded at 17. <span>19+ live clients.</span></p>
            <p class="body">Accessibility-first websites for local businesses and nonprofits: intake, build, deploy, handoff, all solo. Plus Python automation for image pipelines and a CRM that runs itself.</p>
