            </div>
            <div class="links"><a href="https://prospansion.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">prospansion.com →</a></div>
          </section>

          <section class="chapter" data-layer="3">
            <span class="tag"><span class="swatch" style="background:#C79A5B"></span><span class="t"><b>Layer 04</b> · Patty · The data</span></span>
            <h2>Local-First AI &amp; Knowledge Systems</h2>
            <p class="lead">Warvis and Kiln: <span>RAG and training, all local.</span></p>
            <p class="body">Built Warvis, a RAG knowledge system ingesting 700+ documents into a cited, hybrid-search graph (SQLite FTS5 + local embeddings), with a HIPAA-aware PHI-scanning gate on every query (152 passing tests). Also built Kiln, a training loop that raised a local model's eval score from 0.84 to 0.99, gated against a held-out baseline.</p>
            <p class="joke">Unrelated, but worth saying: the patty's grilled chicken, not beef. <b>I'm Hindu, so I swapped it.</b></p>
